flowchart TB
    APP[Application: BookBridgeApp] --> SVC[Service: LibraryService]
    TEST[Automated tests] --> SVC
    SVC --> MODEL[Immutable model and enums]
    SVC --> EX[Domain exceptions]
    SVC --> UTIL[Generic Lookup and Validation]
    SVC --> INPUT[Injected Clock and ID Supplier]
    MODEL --> VALID[Validation helper]
    subgraph Model relationships
        STUDENT[StudentMember: 14 days / PHP 5] --> MEMBER[Abstract Member]
        FACULTY[FacultyMember: 30 days / PHP 2] --> MEMBER
        GUEST[GuestMember: 7 days / PHP 10] --> MEMBER
        LOAN[LoanRecord: ID, ISBN, dates] --> MEMBER
        RES[Reservation: ID, member ID, ISBN, days] -. implements .-> NOTIFY[Notifiable: message only]
        BOOK[LibraryBook: ISBN, title, BookStatus]
        ENUM[MembershipType / LoanStatus / RequestOutcome]
        SUMMARY[CirculationSummary: immutable report]
    end
    MODEL --> MEMBER
    MODEL --> LOAN
    MODEL --> RES
    MODEL --> BOOK
    MODEL --> ENUM
    MODEL --> SUMMARY
    subgraph Service-owned collections
        MAPS[LinkedHashMap: books / members / active loans]
        QUEUE[ArrayDeque: pending reservations]
        SET[HashSet: checked-out ISBNs / used IDs]
        LIST[ArrayList: loan history]
    end
    SVC --> MAPS
    SVC --> QUEUE
    SVC --> SET
    SVC --> LIST
